infiltrator-software (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Establish the greenfield Infiltrator Software Manager architecture.
  * Add Discover, Installed, Updates, System, Repositories, History and Repair.
  * Add a read-only APT/.deb backend and backend-neutral transaction model.
  * Add persistent Common 1.19.8 Follow OS, Day and Night appearance modes.
  * Package the canonical MB Corpo font set, desktop integration and AppStream metadata.
  * Add verified Debian packaging and immutable GitHub release automation.

